  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EscapeRoom.RoomInteractable
  kind: 1
  role: 2
  puzzle: 3
  title: SECURITY DIRECTIVE
  body: 'Router D is compromised: NEVER use D.

    An authorised route starts at
    S, ends at V, follows directed links, and costs AT MOST 10 ms.


    Ask A for
    the route''s total latency T.

    SHIFT = T mod 5 (the remainder after dividing
    by 5).


    Decode STIR by shifting every letter BACKWARD by SHIFT in the alphabet;
    wrap A back to Z.

    ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ


    Set the decoder shift,
    validate the route, enter four letters, then both authorise for two seconds.'
  worldLabel: {fileID: 1380706852}
