  kind: 1
  role: 1
  puzzle: 3
  title: NETWORK TELEMETRY
  body: 'All links are ONE-WAY; costs are milliseconds.


    S > A: 4       S >
    B: 3

    A > C: 3       A > D: 1

    B > D: 2       B > E: 2

    C > V: 5      
    D > V: 1       E > V: 4


    Start at S and guide a packet through connected
    nodes to V at the lab console. Discuss link timings with B. B holds the updated
    security policy.'
  worldLabel: {fileID: 1940774437}
