  title: INCIDENT LOG A-17
  body: 'Colours were repainted during maintenance.


    Relay diagnostics (top
    row, then bottom):

    1: 1011     2: 0110     3: 1101     4: 0100

    5: 1110    
    6: 1001     7: 0011     8: 1010


    You control the relays at the lab console.
    Describe these signatures to B; ask for the maintenance rule.'
  worldLabel: {fileID: 1740526073}
