  m_Text: 'All links are ONE-WAY; costs are milliseconds.


    S > A: 4       S
    > B: 3

    A > C: 3       A > D: 1

    B > D: 2       B > E: 2

    C > V:
    5       D > V: 1       E > V: 4


    Start at S and guide a packet through connected
    nodes to V at the lab console. Discuss link timings with B. B holds the updated
    security policy.'
